  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\"Year 2049...\\n\r\nLong time ago Human dicovered how to travel to space
    easier with a space ship that is capable of travel both air and space just like
    in those Sci fi movies.  \\n\r\nThey called the Technology B.L.A.S.T.E.R that
    stands for Balistic Light Air Space Travel Earth Resistant.\r\n\r\nIt was a big
    step from humanity towards interstellar exploration and conquest.  \\n\r\n\r\nOliver
    one of the best Pilot has been choosen to Test Drive the capabilities of the ship.
    Unfortunate for him Things Did not go so easy for him.\\n\r\n\r\nUnknown Forces
    appear from nowhere and threated him and He had to fight he could not let them
    reach Earth. \\n\r\nHe knew that he was the only defence right now between them
    and Earth and although he did not know their Intentions yet, someone could figure
    it that they werent good.\r\n\"\r\n  "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
